<span id="A3.T11.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">This person is as meticulous as a hair, and under such heavy rain, he can still find the correct direction at a glance!</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T11.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T11.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;"><span id="A3.T11.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text">Gold Annotations</span></td>
