<span id="A3.T11.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Specific Metric: 0. Literal ren
dering of “如发” inappropriate,should use “meticulous.”</span>
<span id="A3.T11.2.3.2.1.2" class="ltx_p">General Metric1: 0. Idiomatic meaning
lost.</span>
<span id="A3.T11.2.3.2.1.3" class="ltx_p">General Metric2: 0. Expression unnatural.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T11.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
