<span id="A3.T11.2.4.2.1.6" class="ltx_p">The idiom ”心细如发” (heart as meticulous as a hair) was translated as ”as meticulous as a hair,” an inappropriate translation.
This resulted in a score of 0 for this specific indicator, and consequently, a score of 0 for the overall indicator.</span>
<span id="A3.T11.2.4.2.1.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T11.2.4.2.1.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Judge Agent</span>:</span>
