<span id="A3.T13.2.1.12.1.1.3" class="ltx_p">Determine whether the debating agents have reached a consensus.</span>
<span id="A3.T13.2.1.12.1.1.4" class="ltx_p">If consensus is reached, record the agreed-upon evaluation.</span>
<span id="A3.T13.2.1.12.1.1.5" class="ltx_p">If consensus is not reached, review all arguments and counterarguments, then provide your final comprehensive evaluation.</span>
